  "question": {
    "text": "In a triangle the sum of two sides is x and the product of the same two sides is y. If <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;(where c is the third side of the triangle) then the ratio of the inradius to the circumradius of the triangle is"
  },
